LUMA SUMMARY:
First big public-archive/design declaration session. Cozmo discusses where to publish the project, why the raw archive should remain intact and unedited, how the archive will preserve source plus conversation history, and his intent to release the project publicly. The session closes with a formal archival dedication dated 8/30/2026 and the principle that the ugly real history should remain visible.
